# What git tracks in this lab (skills/organize-lab/references/report-contract.md, Git policy).
# Track numerical evidence: lab.json, PLAN.md, REPORT.md, notes/, scripts/, configs/, tests/,
# results/, figures/, data/, logs/, and checkpoint manifests.
# Lab-local ignore is only for transient files; heavy checkpoints and bulky archives are covered
# by the repository .gitignore.
__pycache__/
.cache/
*.pid
*.lock
